Map the original ROM0 read-only at IOP 0x1FC00000, rebuilt from the ROMDIR files at
their console offsets, so ROMDRV finds RESET/ROMDIR and rom0:OSDVER/ROMVER open.
A PS2 card gives no PS1-protocol response (0x81 0x52/0x53/0x57/0x58), as on hardware,
so mcman rejects the PS1 probe; truncated-packet errors name the command and sizes.

